這是一個沒用框架的專案 

初始化
node 20
npm install

需要使用nginx才能測試


打包

npx esbuild public/register/main.js --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/main.js

npx esbuild public/register/init.js --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/init.js  

npx esbuild public/register/lang/en.js --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/lang/en.js
npx esbuild public/register/lang/th-TH.js --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/lang/th-TH.js
npx esbuild public/register/lang/zh-CN.js --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/lang/zh-CN.js
npx esbuild public/register/lang/zh-TW.js --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/lang/zh-TW.js

npx esbuild public/register/main.css --minify --bundle --outfile=build/register/main.css

npx html-minifier-terser public/index.html --collapse-whitespace --remove-comments  --remove-optional-tags --minify-css true --minify-js true -o build/index.html



連入部屬機指令
gcloud compute ssh cashflow-x520 --project=runner-test-416601 --zone=asia-east1-a --tunnel-through-iap